  "steps": [
    "Heat the coconut oil and crackle the mustard seeds, then add the curry leaves.",
    "Add the onions and green chillies and cook on medium heat until deep golden brown, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add the ginger garlic paste and cook for a minute.",
    "Add the tomatoes with the coriander powder, chilli powder, turmeric and salt and cook until the oil separates.",
    "Slit the boiled eggs lightly, add them to the masala with a splash of water and roll gently to coat.",
    "Cook 3 minutes, then sprinkle the garam masala and pepper."
  ]
